 125:lib/freertos/tasks.c **** the task's stack or TCB should be freed.  Sometimes the FreeRTOSConfig.h
 126:lib/freertos/tasks.c **** settings allow a task to be created using either statically or dynamically
 127:lib/freertos/tasks.c **** allocated RAM, in which case a member of the TCB is used to record whether the
